      "message": "I find this vague, do you mean \"as if the VPN had set its underlying networks to null\" ? If so I think it\u0027s more helpful to say it will follow the default network.\n\nOr is this where you describe how there should be no connectivity when the VPN is no connected ? If so, I can\u0027t really figure that sense from this sentence (and if not so, should this doc not mention that fact ?)",
