      "message": "If this is only for logging I suggest we remove this or replace it with the transports. Its guaranteed correctness depends on it running on the handler code in CS, meaning it has to go between two messages and hopefully at such a time the state is always consistent. An alternative could be to log the interface name from the LinkProperties, which will in practice give the same information (more detailed, even) than the type from the NI.",
